  "bodyHash": "06b73d0e2b81b37b",
  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<h3><span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></h3>\n<span><span><span>\"大家好！我目前正在开发一个以丧尸末日为主题的整合包。在寻找增强体验的特定机制时，我决定亲自制作这个模组。它显著增加了我的整合包的难度和沉浸感，所以我认为它会是一个对社区来说很棒的补充。希望大家喜欢！\"<br><img src=\"https://media3.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExZHdubHViM2Zud3FsZ3B0emZ1ODBxOGN4eDB6NTRmaGQyd3Y4OWFnciZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/xnbOxoEiODbcNHRfdf/giphy.gif\"></span></span></span>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<span><span><span>关于模组<br><br>Zombie Multiplier（丧尸倍增）模组通过引入丧尸动态倍增机制，显著增加了在《我的世界》中生存的挑战性。击败丧尸后，存在一个可配置的概率使其生成额外的丧尸，使每次遭遇战都可能演变成一波又一波的亡灵潮。这个模组非常适合寻求更紧张、不可预测的生存体验的玩家。<br><br></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3><span><span><span>主要特性：✨<br><br></span></span></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>动态丧尸生成：</span></span></span><span><span><span> 🔄 被击杀的丧尸有概率进行倍增，创造新的威胁。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>可配置的倍增率：</span></span></span><span><span><span> ⚙️ 可以通过游戏内命令或配置文件调整倍增的概率百分比以及每次事件生成的丧尸数量。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>智能生成逻辑：</span></span></span><span><span><span> 🧠 包含内部检查以防止无限循环，并允许控制模组生成的丧尸是否也能倍增，提供平衡的挑战。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>本地化命令：</span></span></span><span><span><span> 🗣️ 游戏内命令已翻译为英文和葡萄牙语（巴西），以提供更好的用户体验。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3><span><span><span>游戏内命令：🎮<br><br></span></span></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span><span>使用 </span></span></span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier</span></span></span><span><span><span> 命令来管理模组的设置：</span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier set percentage &lt;value&gt;</span></span></span><span><span><span>：&nbsp; 设置丧尸死亡时倍增的概率（0-100）。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier set count &lt;value&gt;</span></span></span><span><span><span>：&nbsp; 设置发生倍增时生成的丧尸数量（1-64）。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier set canmultiplyspawned &lt;true/false&gt;</span></span></span><span><span><span>：&nbsp; 确定由本模组生成的丧尸是否也可以倍增。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier set naturalonly &lt;true/false&gt;</span></span></span><span><span><span>：&nbsp; 确定只有自然生成的丧尸才会倍增。这将覆盖 </span></span></span><span><span><span>canmultiplyspawned</span></span></span><span><span><span> 设置。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier get percentage</span></span></span><span><span><span>：&nbsp; 显示当前的倍增概率。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier get count</span></span></span><span><span><span>：&nbsp; 显示当前的丧尸生成数量。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier get canmultiplyspawned</span></span></span><span><span><span>：&nbsp; 显示生成的丧尸是否可以倍增。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>/zombiemultiplier get naturalonly</span></span></span><span><span><span>：&nbsp; 显示是否只有自然丧尸可以倍增。<br><br></span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3><span><span><span>兼容性：✅<br><br></span></span></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>Minecraft 版本：1.20.1</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>&bull;</span></span><span><span><span><span>Forge 版本：47.2.0 或更高版本<br><br></span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3><span><span><span>安装指南：🛠️<br><br></span></span></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>确保您已为 1.20.1 版本安装了 Minecraft Forge。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>下载 </span></span></span><span><span><span>zombiemultiplier-1.0.0.jar</span></span></span><span><span><span> 文件。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>将下载的 </span></span></span><span><span><span>.jar</span></span></span><span><span><span> 文件放入您的 Minecraft </span></span></span><span><span><span>mods</span></span></span><span><span><span> 文件夹中。</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span><span><span>启动 Minecraft，享受更加激烈的丧尸浪潮吧！🚀</span></span></span></span></div>\n</div>",
